From 3251f3e5977cd926f2a8bec4f6a1c32bd8019e9e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zenieverse <zenieverse@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 02:05:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(healthalert): rename ST Cool to HealthAlert Companion
 and consolidate overlapping alert implementations

- Rename ST Cool navigation tab, headings, and branding to HealthAlert Companion
- Consolidate duplicate StCoolModule and HealthAlertModule into single authoritative HealthAlertCompanionModule
- Retain StCoolModule and HealthAlertModule as backwards-compatible delegation wrappers
- Unify ST_COOL_DISCLAIMER and HEALTH_ALERT_DISCLAIMER with consistent non-diagnostic safety notice
- Update DrTHealthBridge and CommandPalette with HealthAlert Companion navigation
- Retain dual /api/st-cool and /api/health-alert endpoints for complete API backwards compatibility
- Update verification and invariant test assertions in test-st-cool.ts and test-health-alert.ts
